    "backstory": "Wrenched from the ferroconcrete ruins of the Flow Below, Scythe was already hardened by the drip-dust storms and scavenged scraps that defined his early life. The moment he found the half-rusted Deboner, he knew his purpose was slicing through the gristle of Subchain City's problems.",
